# Feature Engineering Outputs

This directory is automatically populated when running feature engineering scripts.

## Current Status: Empty
Run feature engineering scripts to generate outputs here.

Example commands:
```bash
python src/feature_engineering/cnn_feature_engineering.py --dataset MNIST --save-features
python src/feature_engineering/rnn_feature_engineering.py --dataset IMDB --save-features  
python src/feature_engineering/transformer_feature_engineering.py --dataset CoLA --save-features
```
